# Diagnostics
```
invalid.vue:3:13 lint/nursery/noTailwindLegacyImportant  FIXABLE  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  ! The Tailwind CSS class !flex puts the important modifier ! before the utility name.
  
    1 │ <!-- should generate diagnostics -->
    2 │ <template>
  > 3 │ <div class="!flex"></div>
      │             ^^^^^
    4 │ <div :class="['!grid', { '!underline': active }]"></div>
    5 │ </template>
  
  i Tailwind CSS v4 expects the ! at the end of the class name, and only accepts it before the utility name for backward compatibility.
  
  i Use flex! instead.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
  i Safe fix: Move the ! to the end of the class name.
  
    1 1 │   <!-- should generate diagnostics -->
    2 2 │   <template>
    3   │ - <div·class="!flex"></div>
      3 │ + <div·class="flex!"></div>
    4 4 │   <div :class="['!grid', { '!underline': active }]"></div>
    5 5 │   </template>
  

```

